  "dcterms:title": "Family phone",
  "dcterms:description": "The one smartphone the family shares, holding one VHL QR per member (J4); holds links, not keys to anyone's records beyond what each link grants.\n\n**Persona**: A shared Android phone, sometimes offline; whoever holds it can show any member's QR, the passcode protects the records.\n\n**Also known as**: Personal health wallet\n\n**Played in the journeys by**: The family's shared phone (fictional).",
